            "review_title": "Review at El Gaucho | Danang",
            "review_text": "Imi\nBangkok, Thailand113 contributions\n0\nOutstanding Steak, Exceptional Lamb and Brilliant Service\nJul 2026 • Friends\nWe had a wonderful dining experience at El Gaucho. The quality of the meat was outstanding, and every cut was cooked perfectly. The real highlight of the evening was the lamb – incredibly tender, full of flavour, and simply one of the best I've ever had.\nI also highly recommend the El Enemigo Malbec 2020. It paired beautifully with both the steak and the lamb, making an already excellent meal even better.\nA special mention goes to Martin, our waiter. He made our evening truly memorable with his genuine warmth, friendly personality, and attentive service. He made us feel welcome from the moment we arrived.\nThe Vietnamese staff were all polite and professional, but the service sometimes felt rather mechanical. Martin brought the personal touch and genuine hospitality that made all the difference. Having someone like him on the team really elevates the entire experience.\nIf you're visiting El Gaucho, do yourself a favour and order the lamb with a glass of El Enemigo Malbec. You won't regret it. We'll certainly be back. Highly recommended! ⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐\nRead more\nWritten July 28, 2026",
            "rating": 5.0,
            "review_date": "2026-10-04",
            "travel_date": "Recent",
            "feature_depth_status": "Schema-Full-Features-Validated"
        },
